    1,
    'A7',
    ARRAY['A7'],
    'Mia buys 4 packs of 25 stickers. Total stickers?',
    '100',
    'exact',
    '25+25+… (4 times) = 100',
    '25×4=100×4/4=400/4=100',
    10500,
    '[{"level": 1, "text": "Notice that 25 is one quarter of 100. How could multiplying by 100 first help here?", "cost": 0}, {"level": 2, "text": "Use the \u00d725 shortcut: multiply 4 by 100 first, then divide by 4.", "cost": 5}, {"level": 3, "text": "Multiply the given number by 100 first. Your final step is to divide that result by 4 \u2014 try halving twice.", "cost": 15}]'::jsonb,
    '×25 = ×100÷4. ×125 = ×1000÷8. Use the round number, then divide!',
    '25 coins? Think ''100 divided by 4'' — it''s the same thing.',
    ARRAY['multiplication', '×25', 'shortcut', 'zone-1'],
    19,
    2
);

