    '48',
    'exact',
    'Trace every edge: 10+4+4+4+4+4+10+4+4=48',
    'Perimeter invariance: missing sides equal the sides they parallel. Horiz=10+10=20, Vert=10+10=20, notch adds 4+4+4+4−... Use: total perimeter=2×(10+10)+extras=48',
