    'structural',
    1,
    'D1',
    ARRAY['D1'],
    'Mia''s necklace has 6 beads on each side with 1 centre bead. Total beads?',
    '13',
    'exact',
    'Count: 1+6+6=13',
    '6×2+1=13',
    8500,
    '[{"level": 1, "text": "Does this problem have a mirror or line of symmetry? What happens if you fold it in half?", "cost": 0}, {"level": 2, "text": "Use symmetry: if both halves are identical, find one half''s value and double it (then add the centre if there is one).", "cost": 5}, {"level": 3, "text": "Identify the centre element (if any) and the two symmetric halves. Compute one half, double it, and add the centre value.", "cost": 15}]'::jsonb,
    'Symmetry is a shortcut: compute one half, double it, add the centre — three steps instead of summing everything!',
    'Symmetric patterns are their own shortcut — one half tells you the whole story.',
    ARRAY['sequences', 'symmetry', 'half-double', 'zone-1'],
    15,
    2
);

