    'Sym-Sum shortcut: grand total ÷ appearances gives each symbol. Or: total − known sub-sum = unknown!',
    'Balance puzzles have a hidden shortcut: add everything up, then peel away what you know.',
    ARRAY['algebra', 'balance', 'sym-sum', 'equilibrium', 'zone-5'],
